00:07:45.707 --> 00:07:48.909
I thought it wasn't real until
it started actually walking.

00:07:48.909 --> 00:07:50.249
I'm like, oh my goodness,

00:07:50.249 --> 00:07:51.082
You know what I mean?

00:07:51.082 --> 00:07:53.047
But that's what he does
throughout every episode.

00:07:53.047 --> 00:07:54.143
He scares me.

00:07:54.143 --> 00:07:56.415
How do I know something is not coming?

00:07:56.415 --> 00:07:57.878
But I don't know, it's not coming.

00:07:57.878 --> 00:08:01.084
It's too much, like this fang.

00:08:01.084 --> 00:08:03.844
- You said too much like your one fang.

